    <string name="troubleshoot_4">– 授权失败并提示“Neither user 2000 nor current process has GRANT_RUNTIME_PERMISSIONS?”？请开启上述安全设置。</string>
    <string name="troubleshoot_5">– 授权会一直保留到卸载为止。也可改用 root 执行 pm grant（su -c pm grant ...）。</string>
